<section class="content">

<h3>Verse to memorize</h3>

<div class="bible-passage">
<p>&laquo;For freedom Christ has set us free; stand firm therefore, and do not submit again to a yoke of slavery.&raquo;</p>
<p class="bible-passage__ref">&mdash; Galatians 5:1</p>
</div>

</section>

<section class="content">

<h3>Prayer for this week</h3>

<blockquote>
<p>Lord Jesus, you who have made me free,<br />
teach me to use that freedom well.<br />
Free me from confusing freedom with whim,<br />
from letting myself be carried away by what I feel like<br />
instead of choosing what is good for me.<br />
Give me the courage to say &laquo;no&raquo; to what enslaves me<br />
and &laquo;yes&raquo; to what makes me greater.<br />
May I never forget that I am your child, not a slave.<br />
Amen.</p>
</blockquote>

